},"ranking":{"user_row":3279,"user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","business_row":1726,"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","nv_rank":377,"mm_rank":345,"nv_score":0.5902220606803894,"mm_score":0.5807558298110962,"rank_movement":32,"has_visual_feature":true,"name":"French Truck Coffee","address":"1200 Magazine St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70130","stars":4.5,"review_count":297,"categories":["Coffee & Tea","Food"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":377,"mm_rank":345,"target_category_support_fraction":1.0,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":5,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Coffee & Tea","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","review_id":"GtZ0KFJXeDYiigGDmXGAXg","date":"2017-03-13T02:55:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.945645272731781,"text_excerpt":"I love finding local coffee shops to visit to when I travel and French truck coffee didn't disappoint. The place is adorable in a little yellow building, you can smell the roasting coffee beans in the cafe. We got the New Orleans ice coffee, half sweetened and it was deliciously creamy without being too sweet. We even made a second visit! We got the hibiscus tea iced with sparkling water added and it was very refreshing. I bought a t-shirt and the cashier also gave me a bunch of free cute stickers! Service is super friendly and coffee is delicious. I'd recommend this place to anyone~"},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","review_id":"ydFkzYSbqG4Abx4N5Vqkdw","date":"2016-02-17T00:59:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9426741003990173,"text_excerpt":"Stumbled upon this place while walking from the French Quarter to the Garden District. In their little space, they've created such a charming atmosphere. There's this glass wall with a glass door in it that separates the public area from the private area, where they roast the beans. They have a little counter space to sit at, looking out to the street, and a number of spots to sit outside. My boyfriend and I both had their New Orleans iced coffee; we just had to, being from San Francisco (home of Blue Bottle). In comparison to Blue Bottle, the portion here was huge (probably a 16 oz for the same price of an 8 oz), and the coffee tasted smoother and milkier, but not losing the taste of cof..."},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","review_id":"seZsMVrap8Xm0XY2HyAtIw","date":"2018-01-23T01:53:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9370933771133423,"text_excerpt":"I had French Truck a couple of times while in New Orleans and for the most part, I really enjoyed it. One morning my husband and I got a cappuccino and a café au lait at the French Quarter location. Both were totally fine and good, but the espresso they use is a little too fruity for my taste. But that's personal preference. We were wandering around and stopped into this location and shared a New Orleans iced coffee. We got it sans sugar, which was perfect. We don't normally sweeten our coffee so this still had a slight sweetness to it, it was the perfect treat. I also loved the crushed ice, it kept it really cold. I'd definitely stop in here if you're trekking around the Garden District."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","photo_id":"u_2crAsbJ-WxkcIcmk9_pA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/u_2crAsbJ-WxkcIcmk9_pA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8930886387825012},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","photo_id":"BNXtzW6NWK9VeC8KEkofUA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/BNXtzW6NWK9VeC8KEkofUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8893688321113586},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","photo_id":"dbts_Cp0avO5Cg4ea36t0w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dbts_Cp0avO5Cg4ea36t0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462273478507996},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","photo_id":"4Qp2DY3mbpuzsqj1CxWaBA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/4Qp2DY3mbpuzsqj1CxWaBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8088730573654175},{"business_id":"g2jeKyXYwHUaiop2UPOFXQ","photo_id":"qTBPmQXuX2w8vmviNQk8Aw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qTBPmQXuX2w8vmviNQk8Aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8086014986038208}]},"notebook_case":null}
